# RAKSHYA Enterprise Defense Console - Frontend Environment Variables
#
# Production Deployment (Vercel):
# Set VITE_API_URL in the Vercel Project Settings > Environment Variables:
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend-api-url.com/api
#
# If running locally with proxy:
# VITE_API_URL=/api
VITE_API_URL=/api
